        {
            "jpName": "ナリタトップロード",
            "enName": "Narita Top Road",
            "jpText": "ふふっ。――同じものを、ですね！\n甘口醤油ラーメン一丁！！",
            "enText": "Heh, you'll have what they're having, huh?\nSure thing. <i>One sweet shōyu ramen!!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 173,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 47,
                    "pathId": 4595793032822926785
